.TITLE "softwareupdate"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
Manages software updates on macOS, allowing users to check for, download,
and install macOS system updates, as well as updates for Apple applications
and command-line developer tools. It provides command-line control
over the update process.

.DIV "ALIAS"
**updates**

.DIV "TLDR"
**softwareupdate --list**
Lists all available software updates.
> 

**softwareupdate --install --all**
Downloads and installs all available software updates.
> 

**softwareupdate --install __"macOS Ventura 13.5-22G120"__**
Installs a specific update by its full name or partial name.
> __"macOS Ventura 13.5-22G120"__: The full name of the update to install.

**softwareupdate --download --all**
Downloads all available updates without installing them.
> 

.DIV "SUMMARY"
Running `softwareupdate` periodically helps keep your macOS system secure
and up-to-date. Ensure you have a stable internet connection and sufficient
disk space before initiating large updates. Always back up important data.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**mac:pmset**

